{"id":"poem-0012-p1","n":12,"title":{"en":[["These","","a"]," ",["I","","s"]," ",["Singing","","p"]," ",["in","","d"]," ",["Spring","","p"]],"zh":[["惠","huì","s"],["特","tè","s"],["曼","màn","t"],["诗","shī","o"],["选","xuǎn","o"]],"ja":[["第","だい","s"],["12","","a"],["章","しょう","c"]]},"p":[{"id":"english-poetry-anthology-s0012-p00029","src":"These I singing in spring collect for lovers,\n(For who but I should understand lovers and all their sorrow and joy?\n And who but I should be the poet of comrades?)\n Collecting I traverse the garden the world, but soon I pass the gates,\nNow along the pond-side, now wading in a little, fearing not the wet,\nNow by the post-and-rail fences where the old stones thrown there, pick'd from the fields, have accumulated,\n(Wild-flowers and vines and weeds come up through the stones and partly cover them, beyond these I pass,)\nFar, far in the forest, or sauntering later in summer, before I think where I go,\nSolitary, smelling the earthy smell, stopping now and then in the silence,\nAlone I had thought, yet soon a troop gathers around me,\nSome walk by my side and some behind, and some embrace my arms or neck,\nThey the spirits of dear friends dead or alive, thicker they come, a great crowd, and I in the middle,\nCollecting, dispensing, singing, there I wander with them,\nPlucking something for tokens, tossing toward whoever is near me,\nHere, lilac, with a branch of pine,\nHere, out of my pocket, some moss which I pull'd off a live-oak in Florida as it hung trailing down,\nHere, some pinks and laurel leaves, and a handful of sage,\nAnd here what I now draw from the water, wading in the pond-side,\n(O here I last saw him that tenderly loves me, and returns again never to separate from me,\nAnd this, O this shall henceforth be the token of comrades, this calamus-root shall,\nInterchange it youths with each other! let none render it back!)\n And twigs of maple and a bunch of wild orange and chestnut,\nAnd stems of currants and plum-blows, and the aromatic cedar,\nThese I compass'd around by a thick cloud of spirits,\nWandering, point to or touch as I pass, or throw them loosely from me,","u":[{"en":[["These","","a"]," ",["I","","s"]," ",["singing","","p"]," ",["in","","d"]," ",["spring","","p"]," ",["collect","","o"]," ",["for","","f"]," ",["lovers","","o"],",","\n","(",["For","","f"]," ",["who","","o"]," ",["but","","f"]," ",["I","","o"]," ",["should","","p"]," ",["understand","","o"]," ",["lovers","","o"]," ",["and","","f"]," ",["all","","o"]," ",["their","","a"]," ",["sorrow","","o"]," ",["and","","f"]," ",["joy","","o"],"?","\n "],"zh":[["我","wǒ","s"],["在","zài","d"],["春","chūn","s"],["天","tiān","s"],["歌","gē","s"],["唱","chàng","s"],["时","shí","s"],["为","wèi","s"],["密","mì","a"],["友","yǒu","a"],["们","men","a"],["收","shōu","a"],["集","jí","a"],["了","le","p"],["这","zhè","a"],["些","xiē","a"],["歌","gē","a"],"， （",["因","yīn","d"],["为","wèi","a"],["除","chú","a"],["我","wǒ","a"],["之","zhī","a"],["外","wài","a"],["还","hái","d"],["有","yǒu","p"],["谁","shuí","o"],["能","néng","o"],["懂","dǒng","o"],["得","dé","c"],["密","mì","o"],["友","yǒu","o"],["们","men","o"],["和","hé","o"],["他","tā","o"],["们","men","o"],["所","suǒ","o"],["有","yǒu","p"],["的","de","a"],["忧","yōu","o"],["伤","shāng","o"],["与","yǔ","o"],["欢","huān","o"],["乐","lè","o"],["呢","ne","o"],"？"],"ja":[["春","はる","s"],["に","","d"],["歌","うた","s"],["いながら、","","s"],["私","わたし","s"],["は","","s"],["恋","こい","a"],["人","びと","a"],["たちのためにこれらを","","o"],["集","あつ","a"],["める。 （","","a"],["私","わたし","a"],["のほかに","","d"],["誰","だれ","a"],["が、","","s"],["恋","こい","a"],["人","びと","a"],["たちとそのすべての","","d"],["悲","かな","a"],["しみと","","d"],["喜","よろこ","a"],["びを","","o"],["理","り","a"],["解","かい","a"],["できるだろうか。","","d"]],"src":"These I singing in spring collect for lovers,\n(For who but I should understand lovers and all their sorrow and joy?\n "},{"en":[["And","","f"]," ",["who","","s"]," ",["but","","f"]," ",["I","","s"]," ",["should","","p"]," ",["be","","p"]," ",["the","","a"]," ",["poet